{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17thアンダー楽曲\n「風船は生きている」\n乃木のので解禁されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のラップとまた違う\n爽やかな感じで\n歌っていてとっても楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の歌声は割と分かりやすいので\n聞き分け上手な人は\n歌割りがどこか分かって、\nそこからポジションもだいたい\n予想がつくのではないでしょうか( ◞･౪･)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVは\nカッコよく、\nおもしろく、\nかわいくなっています(*^◯^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV撮影中は仲が良すぎて\nずーっとみんなで笑ってました！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに(*^◯^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/03/10/2792310/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手だけ入って来るササキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/03/10/2792310/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻の穴に入れる寸前で\nちゃんと止めてくれる\n優しいササキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/03/10/2792310/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いが止まらないササキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第２回　江の島将棋頂上決戦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.fujisawa-kanko.jp/message/tsuruno20170311.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つるの剛士さんとの対局は\nたぶん初めてなので\nとっても楽しみです＼( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戸辺先生の弟子対決ということで\n戸辺先生はどちらを\n応援してくれるんでしょうか＼( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日聞いてみましょう。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都内からもアクセスしやすいですし、\nイベント盛りだくさんなので\n是非是非お越しください☻！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}